# Corpus Co order form

::form[submit="Place order" action=/orders method=post honeypot]
group: Contact
- Name (text, "Your name") *
- Email (email) *
group: Plan
- Tier (radio: Free | Pro | Team) *
- Newsletter (checkbox)
- Dark mode (toggle)
group: Attachments
- Purchase order (file)
- Source (hidden, "pricing-page")
::

::form[submit=Send]
- Message (textarea)
::
